  "body": "Rare North Shore Landholding with Exceptional Future Potential.\r\n\r\nAn exceptional opportunity to secure a substantial freehold landholding in one of Auckland's most tightly held coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a prominent 2,565m² approx freehold site, 168 Deep Creek Road offers vacant possession and outstanding flexibility for purchasers seeking to occupy, repurpose or redevelop (subject to all necessary approvals).\r\n\r\nThe property is improved with established buildings currently configured for community use, providing immediate functionality while offering significant long-term potential. Whether your vision is educational, religious, community-based, or residential redevelopment, this is a rare opportunity to acquire a strategic site in a sought-after North Shore location.\r\n\r\nZoned Residential – Mixed Housing Suburban under the Auckland Unitary Plan, the property benefits from future development potential while being surrounded by established residential neighbourhoods, quality schools, local amenities and popular East Coast Bays beaches.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to acquire freehold landholdings of this scale, with vacant possession and multiple future-use options, are increasingly rare.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n\r\n•    2,565m² (more or less) freehold site \r\n\r\n•    Vacant possession \r\n\r\n•    Existing improvements suitable for a range of occupiers \r\n\r\n•    Residential – Mixed Housing Suburban zoning \r\n\r\n•    Occupy, repurpose or redevelop (subject to Council approval) \r\n\r\n•    Suitable for education, community, religious or other permitted uses \r\n\r\n•    Prominent North Shore location with excellent accessibility \r\n\r\n•    Well-established residential catchment \r\n\r\n•    Rare opportunity to secure a significant landholding with future upside \r\n\r\n168 Deep Creek Road presents a compelling opportunity for owner-occupiers, developers, investors and community organisations to secure a substantial freehold property in a location where opportunities of this scale seldom become available.\r\n\r\n \r\nContact the Sole Agents:\r\nJanet Marshall 021 464 904 or Mike Ryan on 021 402 461\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n* 2,565m² (more or less) freehold site \r\n* Vacant possession \r\n* Existing improvements suitable for a range of occupiers \r\n* Residential – Mixed Housing Suburban zoning \r\n* Occupy, repurpose or redevelop (subject to Council approval) \r\n* Suitable for education, community, religious or other permitted uses \r\n* Prominent North Shore location with excellent accessibility \r\n* Well-established residential catchment \r\n* Rare opportunity to secure a significant landholding with future upside \r\n\r\n\r\nMore information: https://www.colliers.co.nz/p-NZL67041796",
